WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:05.320
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and since we
finally learned what all the Marvel TV Shows

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:10.700
are going to be including the Netflix shows
I wanted to do a breakdown of everything.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:14.389
Agents of SHIELD is also confirmed for Season
2, but I’ll talk about that more in my SHIELD

00:00:14.389 --> 00:00:16.289
finale video later today.

00:00:16.289 --> 00:00:19.273
If you’re finding me for the first time
every week I do Marvel videos.

00:00:19.273 --> 00:00:24.850
I usually try to post them on Tuesdays, depending
on whether or not DC and Warner Brothers drop

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:26.790
bombs.

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:30.550
Be sure to subscribe to get everything.

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:37.790
Now that SHIELD is going on Hiatus future
Tuesdays will be Star Wars and Marvel videos.

00:00:37.790 --> 00:00:40.890
Feel free to leave me suggestions for videos
to do.

00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:43.250
So here’s what’s coming, you’ve probably
heard about some of this stuff.

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:45.360
Number 1 - Agent Carter.

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:47.910
This fall the Peggy Carter TV Show is premiering.

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:52.700
It’s already been picked up for a half season,
meaning it will get 13 episodes.

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:54.140
They haven’t announced a premiere date.

00:00:54.140 --> 00:00:57.829
But I expect it to air alongside Agents Of
SHIELD Season 2.

00:00:57.829 --> 00:00:59.940
That premiered at the end of September last
year.

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:03.250
So tentatively plan on it starting sometime
in September.

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:08.130
Haley Atwell is reprising the role from the
Captain America movies too, which is awesome.

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:09.810
In case you haven’t seen it yet.

00:01:09.810 --> 00:01:14.060
There was a Marvel One Shot called Peggy Carter
that picked up after the events of the first

00:01:14.060 --> 00:01:15.470
Captain America film.

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:21.780
The show takes place in 1946 and she’ll
be going on secret missions for the SSR, that’s

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:24.740
the precursor to SHIELD.

00:01:24.740 --> 00:01:27.290
While being a secretary by day.

00:01:27.290 --> 00:01:31.320
Apparently they didn’t treat Women so hot
back then.

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:34.110
Howard Stark will be giving her all her missions,
but it hasn’t been confirmed whether Dominic

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:38.450
Cooper will reprise his role or how many episodes
the Howard Stark character will be in.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:43.400
It sounds like people are expecting him to
come back, but Howard Stark himself to only

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:45.010
be in a couple episodes a season.

00:01:45.010 --> 00:01:47.540
It really is just all about the Peggy Carter
character.

00:01:47.540 --> 00:01:51.310
It would be like Samuel L. Jackson being on
Agents of SHIELD all the time.

00:01:51.310 --> 00:01:54.180
It would steal focus from Clark Gregg and
the rest of the cast.

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:58.220
We’ll probably get to see some cool 1940s
Stark Tech gadgets though.

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:02.040
Maybe even some of the Lola repulsor tech
he showed off in that first Captain America

00:02:02.040 --> 00:02:03.040
film.

00:02:03.040 --> 00:02:05.150
Moving along to the Netflix Series.

00:02:05.150 --> 00:02:09.509
There’s Daredevil, Jessica Jones, Luke Cage
and Iron Fist.

00:02:09.509 --> 00:02:14.040
Each of the shows are going to premiere really
close to the same time in 2015.

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:18.880
There’s no official release date for any
of them yet, but expect them to premiere somewhere

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:22.500
near Avengers Age of Ultron which is May 1st
next year.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:25.500
Each of the four Netflix shows are getting
13 one hour episodes.

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:29.280
Because they’re going to release each of
the shows like House of Cards, you know, dump

00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:30.280
all the episodes at once.

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:33.780
They’re writing them to be like 4 different
13 hour movies.

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:36.120
They’re calling it a binge-friendly approach.

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:40.330
But the really cool thing is that each of
the stories in the shows will build up to

00:02:40.330 --> 00:02:41.881
an Avengers Style Team up called the Defenders.

00:02:41.881 --> 00:02:44.370
That will be a miniseries.

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:47.459
So think of it like a 4 hour Avengers movie.

00:02:47.459 --> 00:02:51.010
The stories will all exist inside the shared
Marvel Universe, but they’re going to be

00:02:51.010 --> 00:02:52.400
their own separate thing.

00:02:52.400 --> 00:02:56.030
Just like Agents Of SHIELD only crossed over
with the movies very briefly.

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:59.690
So we’re not going to see Tony Stark in
any of them or any of the Avengers.

00:02:59.690 --> 00:03:03.590
But the events of the shows will influence
what’s going on later on Agents Of SHIELD

00:03:03.590 --> 00:03:04.910
and in the movies.

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:07.400
So there will be connective tissue at the
story level.

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:12.460
Personally I’m a little nervous about the
idea of having to binge watch 52 hours of

00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:13.460
television.

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:18.560
Since it’s so far off I’m not going to
worry about how I’ll do videos for all those

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:19.660
episodes.

00:03:19.660 --> 00:03:23.620
But I will do bonus videos for big announcements,
like when they start casting actors.

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:26.019
That’s one of the big things they have to
do this year.

00:03:26.019 --> 00:03:29.819
I wouldn’t be surprised if they announced
who’s playing Daredevil, Jessica Jones,

00:03:29.819 --> 00:03:32.239
Luke Cage and Iron Fist at comic con.

00:03:32.239 --> 00:03:34.510
Don’t expect it to happen in Hall H though.

00:03:34.510 --> 00:03:37.030
Remember, Agents of SHIELD was a whole separate
panel.

00:03:37.030 --> 00:03:41.599
And Marvel only has an hour in Hall H to talk
about 4 or 5 movies.

00:03:41.599 --> 00:03:45.380
So they’ll probably use one of their TV
panels to talk about the Netflix shows.

00:03:45.380 --> 00:03:49.460
It’s really exciting that Marvel and Disney
are willing to produce Netflix content so

00:03:49.460 --> 00:03:52.190
I’ll definitely be doing videos once they
start releasing more info.

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:56.159
Based on previous Avengers experience I think
we can plan for each of these different shows

00:03:56.159 --> 00:04:00.300
to deal with Origin stories, just like all
the separate Avenges films established those

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:03.170
characters before they did the Avengers Team
Up movie.

00:04:03.170 --> 00:04:06.799
So don’t worry if you’ve never read the
comics, the shows will explain everything

00:04:06.799 --> 00:04:08.720
you need to know about them.

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:12.770
But the writers are always good about sticking
a bunch of easter eggs in if you are a big

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:13.770
fan of the comics.

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:16.959
They haven’t said if they intend for the
shows to continue and get more than one season,

00:04:16.959 --> 00:04:19.750
but if they’re successful I’m sure they’ll
keep making them.

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:26.259
House of Cards was so successful that they
greenlight Season 3 before Season 2 even started.

00:04:26.259 --> 00:04:30.520
The real reason Marvel is releasing it all
on Netflix is that there’s a very small

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:33.069
amount of space on television for programming
period.

00:04:33.069 --> 00:04:34.139
They’ll have SHIELD season 2 and Agent Carter
on ABC.

00:04:34.139 --> 00:04:36.699
That’s a lot of superhero shows for broadcast
tv.

00:04:36.699 --> 00:04:40.529
So naturally Netflix with infinite space is
the next best place to put everything.

00:04:40.529 --> 00:04:43.249
But now it’s your turn, let me know whether
or not you’re excited to see the new Peggy

00:04:43.249 --> 00:04:45.559
Carter tv show and all the Netflix shows.

00:04:45.559 --> 00:04:50.249
I am excited to finally see a new female comic
book show.

00:04:50.249 --> 00:04:54.020
A lot of the fandom is wondering what that
first female movie is going to be.

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:56.419
Right now the odds are on Black Widow, just
because she’s already been established.

00:04:56.419 --> 00:04:57.419
But let me know what you think!

00:04:57.419 --> 00:04:58.990
Like I said, there’s a ton of stuff going
on this week.

00:04:58.990 --> 00:05:00.300
